      "Nothing about whether the raw direct-answer interface is valid or invalid, because it was never exercised against a model.",
      "Nothing that generalizes beyond the registered checkpoints, depths and interface, because there is no result to generalize."
    ]
  },
  "next_action_rule": {
    "statement": "Study 4F-E1 stops at the registered section 4.1 state. Resuming requires an approved VM-family vCPU quota of 40 for Standard_NC40ads_H100_v5, or 24 for Standard_NC24ads_A100_v4, in a region that is otherwise eligible. The self-service quota API already refused the single permitted request, so approval must come through the operator-facing packet. Once quota exists the successor re-runs read-only discovery, enters section 4.2 with at most four on-demand attempts, and continues with the instrument unchanged.",
